":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.4.beta4 (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/93d270693079ea7802c9e1334a2e0ecd8529eeed)\n- Reproducible in 4.3.stable\n- Didn't test earlier versions but likely reproducible too, it's not a bug per se, just too verbose an error log.\n\n### System information\n\nFedora Linux 41 (KDE Plasma) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 7600M XT (RADV NAVI33) - AMD Ryzen 7 8845HS w/ Radeon 780M Graphics (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen browsing the Asset Library, some assets occasionally seem to raise this error:\n```\nERROR: Condition \"!_check_request_url(p_method, p_url)\" is true.\n   at: request (core/io/http_client_tcp.cpp:152)\n```\n\nI saw it reproduce with this asset: https://godotengine.org/asset-library/asset/1667\n\nThe icon file is at https://bitbucket.org/arlez80/godot-midi-player-g4/downloads/icon.png and seems to be valid. Not sure what the problem is with that URL or file.\n\nMy expectation as a user of the asset library would be to not see such error, even if the icon can't be retrieved for a valid reason. This could be a verbose message, but also if this is something that can happen in the wild, this error check needs an explicit error message.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open Godot project\n- Search for \"Godot MIDI Player\" on asset library https://godotengine.org/asset-library/asset/1667\n- See the error in output dialog\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nn/a","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102960/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102960/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}